<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>生命周期 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.157.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.4-20260308100717-fe7105a3</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 10:10:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%94%9F%E5%91%BD%E5%91%A8%E6%9C%9F/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>初生微论篇第八</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-08/</link><pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 10:10:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/waijing-08/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%A4%96%E7%BB%8F/">外经</category><description>这是一篇关于&lt;strong&gt;人体生长发育规律与天癸（生命精华）盈虚&lt;/strong&gt;的医学与养生理论短文。文中通过容成与岐伯的问答，解释了婴幼儿发育的生理机制，并探讨了《黄帝内经》关于天癸盛衰周期的记述逻辑。</description></item><item><title>上古天真论篇第一</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-01/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jan 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/suwen-01/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与歧伯讨论了古今人寿命差异，认为古人因遵循天地之道、调和阴阳、节制欲望而长寿，现代人则因生活无节、过度消耗而早衰；歧伯解释了男女衰老与生育能力的关系，指出真正修炼养生之人，能够延年益寿，甚至在百岁后仍保持生育能力。</description></item></channel></rss>